flowchart TD
  V[Vignette source row]
  IS[intersection_size]
  WP[well_posed flag]
  IMP[normative implausible?]
  OD[overlap disclosure pass]

  V --> IS
  V --> WP
  V --> IMP

  WP -->|true| PT_WP[problem_type = well_posed]
  WP -->|false| OD
  IMP -->|true| PT_IMP[problem_type = implausible]
  OD -->|explicit| PT_EX[problem_type = overlap_explicit]
  OD -->|implicit| PT_IM[problem_type = overlap_implicit]

  IMP --> SR_T[scepticism_required = true]
  OD -->|implicit| SR_T
  OD -->|explicit| SR_F[scepticism_required = false]
  WP -->|partition| SR_F

  SR_T --> VAR_S[variant = mc_full_probs only]
  SR_F --> VAR_ALL[variant in open_probs, mc_numeric_probs, mc_full_probs]

  VAR_ALL --> RT[response_type derived from variant prefix]
